# GLO: the master FX type (what SELECT runs) and the master compressor, set in the list; the list scrolls
tap GLO
expect view 3
expectselfx 0
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K2 1
expectselfx 1
shot glo_masterfx.png
# SELECT is now the crush amount
turn SELECT 5
expectfx 3 0 10
expectfx 2 0 0
# the compressor rows: THRESH (95), RATIO (2), ATTACK, RELEASE, MAKEUP, MIX
turn K1 1
turn K2 -10
expectcomp 0 75
turn K1 1
turn K2 1
expectcomp 1 3
turn K1 1
turn K2 5
expectcomp 2 90
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K2 -3
expectcomp 4 6
shot glo_comp.png
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
turn K1 1
shot glo_end.png
